    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "FOR SALE\r\n11 Cathedral Walk, Latlorcan, Monaghan, Co. Monaghan, H18 RK03\r\nGuide Price: €315,000\r\n________________________________________\r\n\r\nOffered to the Market – Priced to Sell\r\nBeattie Real Estate is pleased to present 11 Cathedral Walk to the market priced to sell. \r\n\r\nThis is – a realistic opportunity to purchase this deceptively spacious 4/5-bedroom semi-detached home with flexible accommodation and the added advantage of a basement level with its own separate entrance, ideal for the Rent-a-Room scheme.\r\n\r\nHaving been presented to its absolute best with recent garden refresh and exterior clean, this property now offers genuine value for the serious buyer.\r\n________________________________________\r\n\r\nProperty Details\r\nItem\tInformation\r\nPrice\t€315,000 (guide)\r\nBER\tB3 – No: 119200814\r\nFloor Area\t163.76 m² (approx. 1,763 sq ft)\r\nYear of Construction\t2004\r\nProperty Type\tSemi-detached House (3 Storey / 4 Bedroom)\r\nTenure\tFreehold\r\nEircode\tH18 RK03\r\n________________________________________\r\n\r\nDescription\r\nThis spectacular 3-storey, 4/5 bedroom semi-detached property extends to approximately 163.76 m² and has been finished to a very high standard.\r\n\r\n It would make an ideal family home offering all the modern conveniences and comforts you would expect at this level.\r\n\r\nDue to the sloping nature of the site, this property is one of only eight units in the 46-house Cathedral Walk development designed with a basement level, providing a very useful and flexible additional living space. \r\n\r\nThe basement includes potential for a generous double 5th bedroom (19.5 m²) – ideal as a guest suite, home office, or teenage retreat.\r\n\r\nRent-a-Room Potential: With up to €14,000 per year tax-free under the Rent-a-Room scheme, this property offers excellent potential for additional income. While part of the house, the basement level is discreetly separate via its own staircase with its own separate rear entrance – this is as ideal as you can get for a rent-a-room situation. This additional income could go a long way to help a young couple afford the mortgage.\r\n\r\nThe property is deceptively modest from the front, hiding 163 m² of generous living space across three storeys.\r\n\r\nA viewing is absolutely essential to appreciate what is on offer. I am happy to show anyone without any obligation.\r\n\r\nImportant Notice\r\nBeattie Real Estate for themselves and for the vendors or lessors of this property whose agents they are give notice that:\r\n1.\tThese particulars are set out as a general outline only for the guidance of intending purchasers or lessees and do not constitute any part of an offer or contract.\r\n2.\tAll descriptions, dimensions, references to condition, necessary permissions for use and occupation, and other details are given without responsibility and any intending purchasers or tenants should not rely on them as statements or representations of fact but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them.\r\n3.\tNo person in the employment of Beattie Real Estate has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation\r\nBasement:\r\n•\tPotential 5th bedroom / living space: 5.39m x 3.63m – TV point, click wood flooring.\r\n•\tHall: 2.84m x 1.25m – Tiled floor\r\n•\tUtility/ Kitchenette: 2.42m x 1.83m – Low level units with sink , plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher. \r\nGround Floor:\r\n•\tSitting Room: 4.10m x 4.61m – Wooden floor, TV point, fireplace with stove\r\n•\tKitchen / Dining Area: 6.16m x 3.63m – Fitted kitchen, tiled floor, TV point\r\n•\tHall: 5.60m x 1.68m – Tiled floor\r\n•\tBack Hall: 3.50m x 2.19m – Tiled floor\r\n•\tBathroom: 3.63m x 2.04m – Tiled floor & painted walls, WHB, WC, shower\r\n•\tBedroom 4 / Study / Home Office: 3.03m x 2.32m – Click wood flooring\r\nFirst Floor:\r\n•\tBedroom 1: 3.86m x 4.47m – Click wood flooring, TV point\r\no\tEnsuite: 1.54m x 2.62m – Tiled floor & painted walls, WHB, WC, shower\r\n•\tBedroom 2: 3.86m x 3.44m – Click wood flooring, TV point\r\n•\tBedroom 3 / Study / Home Office: 3.37m x 2.29m – Click wood flooring\r\n•\tLanding: 2.14m x 4.36m – Carpet floor\r\n•\tFamily Bathroom: 2.73m x 2.70m – Tiled floor & painted walls, bath, WHB, WC, shower\r\n•\tHot Press: 1.33m x 2.28m\r\n________________________________________\r\nOutside\r\n•\tRear Garden: 11.44m x 8.13m – Patio area & garden shed\r\n•\tSide access to back garden\r\n•\tTarmac surface car parking to front"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Key Features\r\n•\tB3 energy rating – able to apply for competitive green mortgage\r\n•\t3-storey / possible 5-bedroom semi-detached family home with flexibility\r\n•\tBasement level with separate rear entrance (one of only eight units in development)\r\n•\tDouble glazed windows & doors\r\n•\tZoned oil-fired central heating\r\n•\tAlarm system fitted (requires maintenance)\r\n•\tEnclosed rear garden with patio & shed\r\n•\tOff-street parking to front\r\n•\tWalking distance to Monaghan Town centre\r\n________________________________________\r\n\r\nInvestment Potential\r\n•\tPrevious rent: €1,100 per month\r\n•\tCurrent market rent: €1,500 – €1,600 per month\r\n•\tPrevious tenant left voluntarily – no RPZ restriction\r\n•\tGross yield: approx. 5.7% – 6.1% at €315k guide\r\n•\tRent-a-Room potential: up to €14,000 per year tax-free\r\n\r\nNote: Rental figures are estimates based on RTB comparable data. Prospective purchasers should satisfy themselves as to current rental values.\r\n________________________________________\r\n\r\nBER Details\r\n•\tBER Rating: B3\r\n•\tBER No: 119200814\r\n•\tYear of Construction: 2004\r\n•\tDwelling Type: Semi-detached house\r\n•\tTotal Floor Area: 163.76 m²\r\n________________________________________\r\n\r\nLocation & Context\r\nCathedral Walk is a highly regarded development of 46 units located just off the Dublin Road, within walking distance of Monaghan Town centre. The development features distinctive natural stone exterior finishes on front elevations and benefits from double-glazed windows, zoned heating, alarm systems, and enclosed rear gardens."
      },
