        "Content": "Directions\r\nEircode: H18 RK03\r\n\r\nFrom Monaghan town centre, take the Dublin Road (R937). After the Cathedral, take the first right just past the graveyard. The entrance to Cathedral Walk is on your right. See Sales Sign. No. 11 is clearly marked.\r\nSat Nav: H18 RK03"
